  "details": "Information in the Invites tab does not update on actions, only on manual reloading the page, which then sends you back to the main Groups page.\n\nThis resulted in a bug where one admin was approving/rejecting member requests from his account, while I tried to click a user on my account and the Applicant icons did nothing.\n\nExpectation would be that any positive action would refresh the information on the current page, such as accept/reject, new applicants added, etc.",
